        "Content": "<ul><li>Impressive four-bedroom plus attic family home.</li><li>Superb Dublin 4 location just a short stroll from Sandymount Village.</li><li>Private Scandinavian-style barrel sauna, creating a unique wellness retreat at home.</li><li>Recently renovated in 2021, presented in excellent condition.</li><li>South-facing landscaped rear garden.</ul>"
      },
